# Build Log digest — 15:30 UTC = 17:30 Africa/Gaborone, end of the working day.
#
# CFO 2026-09-11: "i am developing so many things and i am missing things and
# claude is saying it deployed and made it live but it misses so many things
# eg this telegram and CFO morning breif, adding kevins manager."
#
# The board that answers this shipped on 9-Sep and he had no reason to open it.
# Measured on prod the morning he asked: 56 requests recorded, exactly ONE ever
# confirmed live. So the board now comes to him instead.
#
# End of day, not morning, on purpose — it reports what today's sessions claimed
# and what production will actually confirm, and the last deploy of the day has
# usually landed by then.
#
# Sends EVERY day, including a clean one. A digest that only arrives when there
# is news cannot be told apart from one that has silently stopped.
#
# Drop into /etc/cron.d/ (chmod 644, owned by root). Times are UTC.
SHELL=/bin/bash
PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin

30 15 * * * root cd /opt/alpha-finance && /usr/bin/docker compose --env-file /etc/alpha-finance/.env exec -T backend python manage.py devlog_digest >> /var/log/alpha-finance/devlog-digest.log 2>&1
